.el .ds Aq '
.TH start-cli-package-exec 1  "exec "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-package\-exec \- Run a command in a service container and print its output
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli package exec\fR [\fB\-\-stdin\fR] [\fB\-\-timeout\-secs\fR] [\fB\-\-subcontainer\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-image\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-user\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a command in a service container and print its output
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-stdin\fR \fI<STDIN>\fR
Text written to the command\*(Aqs standard input
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\-secs\fR \fI<TIMEOUT_SECS>\fR
Seconds before the command is terminated; defaults to 120
.TP
\fB\-\-subcontainer\fR \fI<SUBCONTAINER>\fR
Guid of the subcontainer, or a prefix; use \-\-name to select by name
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Name of the subcontainer
.TP
\fB\-\-image\-id\fR \fI<IMAGE_ID>\fR
Docker image identifier
.TP
\fB\-\-user\fR \fI<USER>\fR
User name to run as
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Package identifier
.TP
[\fICOMMAND\fR]
Command to execute in the container
